                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Lattice spacing in meters, or 0 for auto. Auto lets FluidX3D size the lattice to the Memory budget (the spacing is whatever the domain happens to get). A value fixes the discretization: ceil(L/dx) cells per axis, Memory becomes a check. Cell count grows with 1/dx^3 — halving dx costs 8x VRAM and ~16x time.</item>
