                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Warm-up seconds discarded before the time mean. Setting this, Averaging or Settle switches a plain solve from Sim Time with per-interval frames to warm-up + averaging through the solver's own time mean (the final u-&lt;step&gt;.vtk IS the mean). 0 with Averaging or Settle set = auto: 2 flow-throughs of the domain at Uref, at least 60 s. Never used by a Live or Interactive run.</item>
