                    <chunk name="param_input" index="13">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Stop the run early once its running mean has settled: the mean field's change between two consecutive flow-throughs under 3 % (two pairs in a row), never before Warmup + Averaging have passed. The solver is given 4x the averaging window and stopped by LBM Run as soon as it settles; a running-mean frame lands per flow-through meanwhile. Off = run exactly the window.</item>
