                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Result time to probe — the dropdown lists every time written on disk: latestTime (default) = latest written time, a number = that written time, all = every written time still on disk (empty, as before the dropdown, reads every probed time). Times that were purged (Keep Time Steps) cannot be probed. FluidX3D results also accept avg (mean over every written time) and avg:START-END (mean over a window in seconds, e.g. avg:120-360 to skip the spin-up transient).</item>
