                        <chunk name="InputParam" index="20">
                          <items count="6">
                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Disregard the terrain: the ground is flat at z = 0 and every building stands on it, lowered whole by the median ground under it, so a roof keeps its shape and its height above that ground. Layers lie flat too, tree crowns and trees keep their height above the ground, and there are no bridge decks. Off by default.</item>
